  "title": "How AI Is Transforming Venture Capital in 2025",
  "summary": "Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer a futuristic concept in venture capital (VC)—it's actively reshaping how firms source deals, conduct due diligence, and manage portfolios. As competition intensifies and data volumes grow exponentially, VC firms that harness AI are gaining a strategic edge across the investment lifecycle. In this article, we delve into how AI is disrupting traditional venture capital workflows, enhancing productivity, and redefining the role of investors in a rapidly evolving financial landscape.",
